{
  "name": "MultiExtractor — Corporativo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Corporativo\n\nAgência Virtual (Corporativo), sem captcha: login → troca para a UC do agrupamento → Segunda Via → PDF. `referencia` opcional (padrão: mês atual).\n\n**POST** `/webhook/enel/corporativo`  \nHeader: a chave da credencial *MultiExtractor API Key*\n\n```json\n{\n  \"usuario\": \"login@empresa.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"senha\",\n  \"uc\": \"12345678\",\n  \"referencia\": \"07/2026\"\n}\n```\n\nResposta: `status` = `sucesso` | `atencao` | `erro`, `observacao` e `arquivos[]` com `pdf_base64` de cada fatura.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "206aacc6-5b7d-5c56-9f29-2af58f3b212c",
      "name": "Como usar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "enel/corporativo",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c86a1a5a-c75f-5e48-be1a-ac9822002f64",
      "name": "Receber pedido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "webhookId": "cef93544-6ff3-5d74-bd80-df1711833ce2",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "multiextractor-api-key",
          "name": "MultiExtractor API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://worker:8000/extracoes/corporativo",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "timeout": 1800000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}"
      },
      "id": "58aebeea-9684-51fb-95d0-7079cb801285",
      "name": "Extrair no worker",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        160
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body ?? { status: 'erro', observacao: 'Worker indisponível: ' + ($json.error?.message ?? 'sem resposta') }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": "={{ $json.statusCode ?? 502 }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "e6a80e8b-4448-551e-9879-3a6345659207",
      "name": "Responder resultado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
